<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from quarterfinals and semifinals of the BellSouth Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding).</p>
<p>Singles, quarterfinals:</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Jan-Michael Gambill (U.S.) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 0-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Rep) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat 5-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Rep) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) v Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark), Monday</p>
<p>11.00 a.m. NZ time (2200 GMT)</p>
<p>Doubles, semifinals:</p>
<p>Ellis Ferreira (South Africa)/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) beat</p>
<p>Dave Adams (South Africa)/Meno Oosting (South Africa) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
<p>Rick Leach (U.S.)/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Jonas Bjorkman</p>
<p>(Sweden)/Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>Ellis Ferreira (South Africa)/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) beat</p>
<p>Rick Leach (U.S.)/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-4 4-6 7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
